<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israel has killed two Hamas military chiefs in eight days, eliminating every confirmed senior commander from active leadership in Gaza.</s> <s>Mohammad Odeh and his predecessor were struck on the twenty-seventh and the fifteenth of May, leaving phase-two ceasefire talks without a named Hamas interlocutor.</s> <s>The talks require disarmament and Israeli withdrawal — and there's now no one of rank left to sign.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Gaza, a sacrificial sheep for Eid al-Adha now costs eleven thousand shekels — eleven times the pre-war price.</s> <s>Israel controls every entry point and is letting in fewer trucks than aid agencies say are needed to bring prices down, with only fifteen thousand sheep remaining for two point one million people.</s> <s>A festival built around sharing meat with the poor has become, this year, a window people look through but cannot enter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Washington, President Trump threatened at cabinet to bomb Oman if it partners with Iran on Strait of Hormuz traffic.</s> <s>Oman has been the quiet broker of the very US-Iran ceasefire talks Trump wants to claim — the strait still carries twenty percent of global oil, closed by Tehran since February.</s> <s>Threatening the mediator is a strange way to keep a channel open.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Seventeen billion dollars has been pledged for Gaza's reconstruction. Not a single dollar has been deposited.</s> <s>Twenty-seven states routed the money around the World Bank into a JPMorgan account with no transparency requirements, and no contracts have been awarded.</s> <s>The board's Palestinian committee cannot even enter Gaza, an adviser said, because there's nothing yet to disburse.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Madrid, the Civil Guard walked into the headquarters of Spain's governing Socialist party, executing a judge's warrant in a corruption probe centred on former party number-three Santos Cerdán.</s> <s>Investigators were searching for evidence of a party disinformation network tied to alleged funding irregularities.</s> <s>Opposition leader Feijóo has demanded snap elections, and Prime Minister Sánchez is still standing by his former lieutenant.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary's parliament voted one hundred and thirty-three to thirty-seven to cancel its planned exit from the International Criminal Court.</s> <s>Viktor Orbán had launched the withdrawal in April of last year, after the court issued a war crimes warrant against Israel's Netanyahu.</s> <s>New Prime Minister Magyar says Budapest will now execute every outstanding ICC warrant — including, if he visits, the one against Netanyahu.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Accra, Ghana flew two hundred and ninety-five of its citizens out of South Africa as anti-immigrant protests threaten a nationwide shutdown by the end of June.</s> <s>South African unemployment exceeds thirty-three percent, and attacks on migrant workers are spreading across Johannesburg.</s> <s>When one African state has to charter planes to pull its people out of another, the African Union's open-borders rhetoric is being tested in public.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Supreme Court has cleared Bihar's purge of sixty-five lakh names from the voter roll on citizenship grounds.</s> <s>Challengers said the Special Intensive Revision was designed to strip Muslim and migrant voters from the electorate.</s> <s>The ruling now applies to every future voter-roll revision nationwide, in sha'Allah before damage compounds.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>California's governor plans to tax payouts from Trump's one point seven seven six billion dollar January sixth compensation fund at one hundred percent.</s> <s>The fund pays defendants the president pardoned, and Capitol Police officers who defended the building that day are already challenging it in court.</s> <s>Sacramento is testing whether state tax law can blunt a federal pardon-with-cash — a federalism precedent worth watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Omaha, fertilizer prices have surged since the strikes on Iran began.</s> <s>US nitrogen fertilizer is made from natural gas, and Hormuz disruptions have reset global input costs for farmers already on razor margins.</s> <s>November's Senate race in Nebraska pits the incumbent Ricketts against a mechanic — and a war eleven thousand kilometres away is now on the ballot in the cornfields.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Damascus, Syria's only working freight line takes a full day on a route that once took four hours, run on Soviet locomotives.</s> <s>Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Jordan have signed a rail accord casting Syria as a Gulf-to-Mediterranean corridor.</s> <s>Whoever finances the reconstruction, and on what terms, will decide who controls the future trade route through the country.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil will spend seventy-five million dollars paving the BR-three-one-nine, the Amazon highway unpaved since its inauguration in nineteen seventy-six.</s> <s>Researchers describe the road as the single strongest infrastructure predictor of Amazon deforestation.</s> <s>Critics say Brasília's environmental safeguards don't begin to offset the forest the pavement will open up.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nvidia has pledged one hundred and fifty billion dollars a year in Taiwan, up from ten to fifteen billion just five years ago.</s> <s>The spending cements chip and AI supercomputer supply chains in Taipei — directly against Washington's onshoring push.</s> <s>Ground breaks on a new Taiwan headquarters this year, with full operations soon after.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>New York and New Jersey have subpoenaed FIFA over ticket pricing for the men's World Cup.</s> <s>Prosecutors allege deceptive variable pricing raised ninety of one hundred and four fixture prices by an average of thirty-four percent, and that FIFA shut down a disabled charity's ticket raffle.</s> <s>The tournament opens across the United States, Canada and Mexico on the eleventh of June — and the host states are already in court with the host body.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Canberra is suing the American chemicals giant 3M for two billion Australian dollars over PFAS contamination of twenty-eight defence bases.</s> <s>The forever chemicals persist in soil and in bloodstreams, and Australia alleges the company knew and concealed it — having already spent a billion dollars on remediation itself.</s> <s>A sovereign state suing a foreign manufacturer for known toxicity sets a template other governments will copy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A new deep-learning model can now forecast wildfire risk thirty-one days ahead.</s> <s>It cuts forecast bias in eighty-five percent of high-exposure, high-poverty grid cells — places that until now had no fire prediction at all because they lack weather stations and fire agencies.</s> <s>The researchers want operational deployment; the current global systems are tuned for the rich countries that built them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Kano, eighty-seven percent of inpatients in northern Nigerian wards were found carrying drug-resistant bacteria.</s> <s>Extended-spectrum beta-lactamase strains defeat the front-line antibiotics, and carriage precedes infection — which means outbreaks are spreading inside wards before surveillance even notices.</s> <s>The authors are calling for surveillance before harder-to-treat strains take hold.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Boston, researchers report a stem cell patch that reversed scarring from a heart attack.</s> <s>After an infarction, damaged muscle normally heals as inert scar; the BioVAT graft places stem-cell tissue onto the damaged wall and restores pumping force.</s> <s>A larger trial will now test who benefits most and how long the new muscle lasts.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran has partially restored international internet on day eighty-eight of a total shutdown.</s> <s>The blackout was imposed when the United States and Israel struck on the twenty-eighth of February, forcing banking and communications onto domestic platforms that may now become the permanent infrastructure.</s> <s>Mobile internet remains cut, and the judiciary has suspended the presidential decree behind the shutdown.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At the Vatican, Pope Leo the Fourteenth has called the concentration of AI wealth an injustice.</s> <s>His encyclical Magnifica Humanitas echoes Leo the Thirteenth's eighteen ninety-one labour text, demanding AI gains be distributed from the outset, not eventually — and he presented it alongside Anthropic co-founder Chris Olah, the first such Vatican-tech pairing.</s> <s>A religious authority has entered a debate dominated until now by venture capital.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In London, the chief executive of Standard Chartered called his bank's compliance officers lower-value capital, as he plans to replace fifteen percent of back-office fraud staff with AI.</s> <s>AI-enabled scams are accelerating at the same moment, and the CEO has set no timeline; the bank has been fined by US regulators before.</s> <s>When the head of fraud prevention dehumanizes his own department, regulators should pay attention.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Google security engineer has been charged with betting three point eight million dollars on Polymarket using the company's internal search-trend tool.</s> <s>Prosecutors say Michele Spagnuolo checked the tool hours before each bet and walked away with one point two million in profit, now facing commodities fraud, wire fraud and money laundering charges.</s> <s>Prediction markets price what people are searching, and the people who watch the searches turn out to be the ultimate insiders.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>